# Copy to .env and fill in. Never commit .env (it's gitignored).

# Web3Forms access key — powers the contact form.
# 1. Go to https://web3forms.com
# 2. Enter the inbox you want submissions delivered to (Jeremymironov@gmail.com)
# 3. Paste the key they email you below
# 4. Add the same key to Vercel: Project → Settings → Environment Variables
#
# This key is public by design — it only identifies the destination inbox.
WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=
